Dialogue: 2,0:23:08.20,0:23:14.25,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H050505&\3c&HDDDDDD&}在另一側 今天仍有人
Dialogue: 2,0:23:14.37,0:23:20.21,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H050505&\3c&HDDDDDD&}日漸頹敗 卻仍然站立
Dialogue: 2,0:23:20.38,0:23:26.09,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H050505&\3c&HDDDDDD&}刺痛胸口的這份寂寞
Dialogue: 2,0:23:26.26,0:23:31.98,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H050505&\3c&HDDDDDD&}點或是線 斷斷續續
Dialogue: 2,0:23:31.98,0:23:35.02,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H050505&\3c&HDDDDDD&}面具碎裂
Dialogue: 2,0:23:35.02,0:23:37.98,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H050505&\3c&HDDDDDD&}那無法迴避的一切
Dialogue: 2,0:23:37.98,0:23:41.03,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H050505&\3c&HDDDDDD&}不得不活下去
Dialogue: 2,0:23:41.03,0:23:45.70,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H050505&\3c&HDDDDDD&}明天已經在等待
Dialogue: 2,0:23:45.70,0:23:51.29,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.5}無邊無際 卻又如此短暫
Dialogue: 2,0:23:51.29,0:23:57.46,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.5}就當作心這種東西 根本不存在吧
Dialogue: 2,0:23:57.71,0:24:00.71,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.5}耀眼得難以直視
Dialogue: 2,0:24:00.71,0:24:04.76,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.5}柔軟的手心
Dialogue: 2,0:24:04.76,0:24:13.06,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.5}那一天 我回握了那隻手
